---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Xravity"
  description="Privacy Policy for Xravity, an independent site sharing design notes, building logs, images, and resources."
>
  <Nav />
  <section class="legal-page-section">
    <div class="legal-container">
      <p class="section-tag">Privacy</p>
      <h1 class="section-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: October 24, 2026</p>

      <div class="legal-body">
        <p>
          Xravity is a personal independent site for publishing articles, images, and useful resources.
          This page explains what information may be collected when you visit this site.
        </p>

        <h2>Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          This site may use privacy-conscious traffic measurement tools or Google Analytics to understand
          page views, traffic sources, device types, and general engagement. Analytics data helps improve
          the site structure, content direction, and reading experience.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          If Google Analytics or similar tools are enabled, they may use cookies or comparable technologies
          to measure visits. You can block or delete cookies through your browser settings.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact Form</h2>
        <p>
          If you submit the contact form, the information you enter, such as your name, email address, and
          message, is used only to respond to your request.
        </p>

        <h2 id="comments">评论与讨论 / Comments</h2>
        <p lang="zh-CN">
          文章评论由 Giscus 和 GitHub Discussions 提供。接近评论区时，浏览器会连接这些服务加载评论，相关服务可接收 IP 地址等常规请求信息。评论、回复、表情反馈和你的 GitHub 公开身份会公开显示，并保存在网站仓库的 Discussions 中。
          参与讨论需要登录 GitHub；网站不会读取你的 GitHub 密码。你可以在 GitHub 编辑或删除自己的评论，站点维护者也可管理、隐藏或删除不当内容。相关处理适用 Giscus 与 GitHub 自身的隐私政策。
        </p>
        <p lang="en">
          Blog discussions use Giscus and GitHub Discussions. When you approach the comments, your browser connects to these services, which may receive standard request metadata such as your IP address. Comments, replies, reactions, and your public GitHub identity are public and stored in this site's repository discussions. Posting requires GitHub sign-in; this site does not receive your GitHub password. You can edit or delete your contributions on GitHub, and the site maintainer can moderate inappropriate content. Giscus and GitHub apply their own privacy policies.
        </p>

        <h2>External Links</h2>
        <p>
          Some resources link to external websites. Xravity is not responsible for the privacy practices or
          content of those third-party sites.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For privacy questions, contact <a href="mailto:hello@xravity.com">hello@xravity.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
